# CW BEGIN header (Concentrated Warfare mod)
# Full-file override of game/in_game/gui/single_unit_window.gui from Europa Universalis V 1.4.7.
# Vanilla file: 5301 lines, 143783 bytes, LF line endings, no BOM, sha256 5c2d8ce0f9c62e31ab57e0484913b764ec26cc4b0909523cd54174d526913d5b
# Everything outside the "# CW BEGIN ..." / "# CW END ..." blocks is byte-identical to vanilla; after a game patch
# re-copy the new vanilla file and re-apply the five blocks (search for "# CW "):
#   (1) this header
#   (2) "tab bar"   - secondary tab row Actions | Headquarters, inserted after the unit card
#   (3) "gate"      - the vanilla illustration gate re-keyed to the tab variable and widened for navies / foreign armies
#   (4) "gate"      - the same for the vanilla actions-content gate
#   (5) "headquarters tab" - the new tab content, a sibling of the vanilla actions content
# Tab state lives in the global GUI variable store (GetVariableSystem, key 'cw_unit_tab', values 'actions' /
# 'headquarters'), set and read exactly like the vanilla tabs of in_game/gui/game_rules.gui; the "tab bar" block
# explains why the window's own SingleUnitWindow.Vars store is not used (deviation from SPEC section 0 / 12.3).
# tools/validate.sh reports 8 warnings for this file (odd number of quotes at the CombatProgress piecharts, four
# gfx/interface_old/from_sulla textures): all of them sit in untouched vanilla content (vanilla lines 531/532/570/571
# and vanilla's own stale texture references), none was introduced by the mod.
# CW END header

